 end="00:34.990">thought </span><span begin="00:34.990" end="00:35.200">I'd </span><span begin="00:35.200" end="00:35.440">take </span><span begin="00:35.440" end="00:35.650">that </span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:36.160">chance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.160" end="00:38.350"><span begin="00:36.160" end="00:36.670">Danced </span><span begin="00:36.670" end="00:36.790">with </span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:36.850">the </span><span begin="00:36.850" end="00:37.120">she </span><span begin="00:37.120" end="00:37.420">devil </span><span begin="00:37.420" end="00:37.510">in </span><span begin="00:37.510" end="00:37.570">the </span><span begin="00:37.570" end="00:37.840">pale </span><span begin="00:37.840" end="00:38.350">moonlight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.470" end="00:40.330"><span begin="00:38.470" end="00:38.800">Alarm </span><span begin="00:38.800" end="00:39.070">bells </span><span begin="00:39.070" end="00:39.280">rang</span><span begin="00:39.280" end="00:39.280">, </span><span begin="00:39.280" end="00:39.400">but </span><span begin="00:39.400" end="00:39.490">I </span><span begin="00:39.490" end="00:39.760">loved </span><span begin="00:39.760" end="00:39.850">the </span><span begin="00:39.850" end="00:40.330">drama</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.480" end="00:42.940"><span begin="00:40.480" end="00:40.630">In </span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:40.720">a </span><span begin="00:40.720" end="00:40.990">dark </span><span begin="00:40.990" end="00:41.230">place </span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.320">but </span><span begin="00:41.320" end="00:41.410">I </span><span begin="00:41.410" end="00:41.650">loved </span><span begin="00:41.650" end="00:41.740">the </span><span begin="00:41.740" end="00:42.310">karma </span><span begin="00:42.310" end="00:42.940">sutra</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.060" end="00:44.080"><span begin="00:43.060" end="00:43.330">Shoulda </span><span begin="00:43.330" end="00:43.6